What is a High Speed Turbine Dental Handpiece?
High Speed Turbine Dental Handpieces are precision instruments used in dental procedures for cutting and grinding tooth structures, including enamel and dentin. These devices utilize high-speed rotating turbines, powered by either pneumatic or electric systems, to achieve efficient and precise dental treatments such as caries removal, tooth preparation, and root canal therapy. Their engineered design ensures optimal performance with minimal vibration and noise, making them indispensable tools in modern dental practice.

